{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in one of the labs of their research station, a group of scientists muster their only resistance against a hostile boarding party. Hacking into the hovering tank drone the invaders brought with them, they manage to compromise its targeting system, turning it - and its powerful railgun - against its former masters. Now the tank must clear the space station of all hostiles - level by level, shot by shot.<br><br><i>IFF</i>\u00a0is a top-down shooter where the player takes control of a hover tank, using its powerful gun and its bouncing projectiles to clear out different types of enemies. The shots are powerful and can clear out a room, but the long cooldown between shots means you need to plan your attack and take advantage of the architecture to maximize effectiveness.<br><br>One shot, one kill. Make them count, and good hunting!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741610?t=1751690984","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741610?t=1751690984","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741610/12571efbd0f8a5bfed70f9391467e52dffb1e974/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751690984","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741610/12571efbd0f8a5bfed70f9391467e52dffb1e974/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751690984","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in one of the labs of their research station, a group of scientists muster their only resistance against a hostile boarding party. Hacking into the hovering tank drone the invaders brought with them, they manage to compromise its targeting system, turning it - and its powerful railgun - against its former masters. Now the tank must clear the space station of all hostiles - level by level, shot by shot.<br><br><i>IFF</i>\u00a0is a top-down shooter where the player takes control of a hover tank, using its powerful gun and its bouncing projectiles to clear out different types of enemies. The shots are powerful and can clear out a room, but the long cooldown between shots means you need to plan your attack and take advantage of the architecture to maximize effectiveness.<br><br>One shot, one kill. Make them count, and good hunting!</p>","developers":["DJMBuilds"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741610/c6b9456e3de53297d32834a4e6e84ba429a9a74b/header.jpg?t=1751690984","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3741610/1400210613/ecac32dda30686360f4ba7a9cfbfdd366605ccb3/1750385175/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749839434","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3741610/1400210613/ecac32dda30686360f4ba7a9cfbfdd366605ccb3/1750385175/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749839434","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3741610/1400210613/ecac32dda30686360f4ba7a9cfbfdd366605ccb3/1750385175/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749839434","id":257154609,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154609/movie480.mp4?t=1749839434","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154609/movie_max.mp4?t=1749839434"},"name":"IFF Prerelease Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257154609/e3e30429219a182a8e36214afff0f216f37fdd2e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749839434","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154609/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749839434","max":"ht